        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ Uhoraho azogirira akagongwe aba Yakobo, azosubira gutoranya Abisirayeli, abasubize mu gihugu cabo bgite: kand’ abanyamahanga bazokwifatanya na bo, bamatane n’inzu ya Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 49:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "60:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.61.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "61:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga azobajana abasubize i wabo, maz’ ab’ inzu ya Isirayeli bazoyatungira mu gihugu c’Uhoraho, yose bayahindure abaja b’abahungu n’abakobga: kand’ abābajana kw inyagano, na bo bazobajana kw inyagano, kandi bazotwara abābahahaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
