              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yemwe Bufilisitiya bgose, nta co munezerezwa n’ukw inkoni yabakubita ivunitse; kuko mu gishitsi c’inzoka hagiye kuvamw’ imvuvyi, kand’ uruvyaro rwayo ruzoba inzoka iguruka y’ubumara buturira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abana b’ imfura b’aboro bazogaburirwa, n’ abakene baryame amahoro; kand’ igishitsi cawe nzocicisha kigoyi, n’amasigarira yawe azokwicwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
